    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i dont even know who i am anymore. everything just feels so empty. it's like the part of me that actually mattered just died with them and i'm just... wandering around a body that doesnt belong to me. what's even the point of trying to rebuild when there's nothing left to build on?",
